{"id":"a11ffd0523da6a6c","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Computable Real","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Real","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Real","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursive-predicate]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0e39684c33d074c\" href=\"?note=d0e39684c33d074c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursive-predicate\">58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursive-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"37437e63af9f668e\" href=\"?note=37437e63af9f668e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function\">58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> (real)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\\)</span> (total-recursive-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"37437e63af9f668e\" href=\"?note=37437e63af9f668e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function\">58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableReal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableReal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableReal}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableReal}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A real in Baire space is computable exactly when its own set-coded function graph satisfies the registered total-recursive-function predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursive-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"d0e39684c33d074c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursive-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function"